<title>UK: AEI's Spanish operation wins ISO 9002.</title>
<headline>AEI's Spanish operation wins ISO 9002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Express International said in a statement that Spain has become the twenty-second country in its network to achieve ISO 9002 quality accreditation.</p>
<p>It added Bureau Veritas has accredited AEI Iberfreight's offices at Alicante, Barcelona, Bilbao, Madrid, Seville and Valencia as meeting the necessary standards. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
